      "designator": "CS23-0",
      "grouping_at_time": "Subpart E \u2014 Powerplant",
      "title_at_revision": "Turbine engine bleed air system",
      "text": "For turbine engine bleed air systems, the following applies:\n(a) No hazard may result if duct rupture or failure occurs anywhere between the engine port and the aeroplane unit served by the bleed air.\n(b) The effect on aeroplane and engine performance of using maximum bleed air must be established.\n(c) Hazardous contamination of cabin air systems may not result from failures of the engine lubricating system.",
